      "title": "ALLE Q3 Earnings Beat on Americas Strength, Outlook Raised",
      "summary": "Allegion plc (ALLE) reported Q3 2026 adjusted earnings of $2.60 per share, up 13% YoY and beating estimates by 4.4%, with revenues growing 9.6% to $1.17 billion. The Americas segment drove growth with 11.7% revenue increase on strong non-residential demand. The company raised its 2026 adjusted EPS guidance to $9.05-$9.10 and revenue growth outlook to 9.5-10.5%, reflecting confidence in continued momentum.",
